n__button\"></span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"book carousel__item\">\n                            <div class=\"book-cover\">\n                                <span class=\"skeleton carousel-skeleton__cover\"></span>\n                            </div>\n                                <span class=\"carousel-caption\">\n                                    <span class=\"carousel-caption__title\"><span class=\"skeleton carousel-skeleton__text\"></span></span>\n                                    <span class=\"carousel-caption__meta\"><span class=\"skeleton carousel-skeleton__text carousel-skeleton__text--short\"></span></span>\n                                </span>\n                            <div class=\"ol-action-row\">\n                                <span class=\"skeleton carousel-skeleton__button\"></span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </template>\n        <div class=\"browse-stacks__shelf\" id=\"browse-stacks-shelf\" hidden></div>\n        <script>\n            (function () {\n                var rail = document.getElementById('browse-stacks-rail');\n                var tiles = Array.prototype.slice.call(rail.querySelectorAll('.browse-stacks__tile'));\n                var pinned = tiles.filter(function (tile) { return tile.hasAttribute('data-pinned'); });\n                var rest = tiles.filter(function (tile) { return !tile.hasAttribute('data-pinned'); });\n                for (var i = rest.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n                    var j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));\n                    var swap = rest[i];\n                    rest[i] = rest[j];\n                    rest[j] = swap;\n                }\n                var slug = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('stack');\n                var requested = tiles.filter(function (tile) { return tile.getAttribute('data-genre') === slug; })[0];\n                if (requested && rest.indexOf(requested) > 0) {\n                    rest.splice(rest.indexOf(requested), 1);\n                    rest.unshift(requested);\n                }\n                tiles = pinned.concat(rest);\n                tiles.forEach(function (tile, index) {\n                    rail.appendChild(tile);\n                    // The rail's first page (8 tiles at its widest) is above the fold.\n                    if (index < 8) {\n                        tile.querySelectorAll('img').forEach(function (img) { img.loading = 'eager'; });\n                    }\n                });\n\n                var template = document.querySelector('.browse-stacks__loading');\n                var shelf = document.getElementById('browse-stacks-shelf');\n                if (!tiles.length || !template) return;\n                var open = requested || tiles[0];\n                var params = new URLSearchParams({ genre: open.getAttribute('data-genre') });\n                var lang = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('lang');\n                if (lang) params.set('lang', lang);\n                shelf.prefetch = {\n                    slug: open.getAttribute('data-genre'),\n                    response: fetch('/partials/HomeGenre.json?' + params),\n                };\n                shelf.prefetch.response.catch(function () {});\n                var data = JSON.parse(open.getAttribute('data-shelf'));\n                var skeleton = template.content.cloneNode(true);\n                skeleton.querySelector('.genre-shelf').setAttribute('data-genre', open.getAttribute('data-genre'));\n                skeleton.querySelector('.genre-shelf__title').textContent = data.name;\n                var jump = skeleton.querySelector('.genre-shelf__jump');\n                var rows = skeleton.querySelectorAll('.carousel-skeleton');\n                rows[0].querySelector('.carousel-skeleton__title').textContent = data.title;\n                data.subgenres.forEach(function (name) {\n                    var row = rows[1].cloneNode(true);\n                    row.querySelector('.carousel-skeleton__title').textContent = name;\n                    rows[1].parentNode.insertBefore(row, rows[1]);\n                    jump.appendChild(document.createElement('span')).textContent = name;\n                });\n                if (!data.subgenres.length) jump.remove();\n                rows[1].remove();\n                shelf.appendChild(skeleton);\n                shelf.hidden = false;\n            })();\n        </script>\n    </section>\n\n\n  <div class=\"library-row\">\n    <section class=\"librarian-card\" aria-labelledby=\"librarian-card-title\">\n        <div class=\"librarian-card__main\">\n            <h2 class=\"librarian-card__title\" id=\"librarian-card-title\">A library made by the people who use it.</h2>\n            <p class=\"librarian-card__body\">A catalog for every book ever published, maintained by readers like you.</p>\n            <ol-button class=\"librarian-card__cta\" variant=\"primary\" href=\"/tasks\" data-ol-link-track=\"HomeLibrarianCard|Tasks\">\n                Start contributing\n                <svg\n    class=\"ol-icon ol-icon--sm\"\n    focusable=\"false\"\n    slot=\"icon-end\"\n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n><use href=\"/static/icons/sprite.svg?v=10ec77c16d212c74860dc4374594de7e#icon-arrow-right\"></use></svg>\n            </ol-button>\n        </div>\n        <dl class=\"librarian-card__facts\">\n            <div class=\"librarian-card__fact\">\n                <svg\n    class=\"ol-icon ol-icon--md librarian-card__fact-icon\"\n    focusable=\"false\"\n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n><use href=\"/static/icons/sprite.svg?v=10ec77c16d212c74860dc4374594de7e#icon-pencil\"></use></svg>\n                <dt>Editable</dt>\n                <dd>\n                    By anyone, like Wikipedia\n                </dd>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"librarian-card__fact\">\n                <svg\n    class=\"ol-icon ol-icon--md librarian-card__fact-icon\"\n    focusable=\"false\"\n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n><use href=\"/static/icons/sprite.svg?v=10ec77c16d212c74860dc4374594de7e#icon-globe\"></use></svg>\n                <dt>Public</dt>\n                <dd>\n                    Every record, free to download\n                </dd>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"librarian-card__fact\">\n                <svg\n    class=\"ol-icon ol-icon--md librarian-card__fact-icon\"\n    focusable=\"false\"\n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n><use href=\"/static/icons/sprite.svg?v=10ec77c16d212c74860dc4374594de7e#icon-landmark\"></use></svg>\n                <dt>Nonprofit</dt>\n                <dd>\n                    Run by the Internet Archive\n                </dd>\n            </div>\n        </dl>\n    </section>\n        <section class=\"library-stats\" aria-labelledby=\"library-stats-title\">\n            <h2 class=\"library-stats__title\" id=\"library-stats-title\">In the last month</h2>\n            <ul class=\"library-stats__grid\">\n                    <li>\n                        <a class=\"library-stat\" href=\"/stats\">\n                            <span class=\"library-stat__figures\">\n                                <span class=\"library-stat__value\">261K</span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"library-stat__label\">New Members</span>\n                            <svg class=\"library-stat__spark\"\n                                 viewBox=\"0 0 120 28\"\n                                 preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"\n aria-hidden=\"true\"                                  focusable=\"false\">\n                                <polyline points=\"2.0,4.2 6.3,4.3 10.6,6.4 14.9,10.1 19.2,13.2 23.5,15.6 27.8,17.0 32.1,15.5 36.4,15.4 40.7,13.7 45.0,11.8 49.3,8.3 53.6,8.7 57.9,8.9 62.1,7.3 66.4,4.0 70.7,2.8 75.0,2.0 79.3,3.2 83.6,2.5 87.9,2.0 92.2,2.7 96.5,4.7 100.8,5.4 105.1,6.2 109.4,5.8 113.7,3.0 118.0,26.0\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></polyline>\n                            </svg>\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <a class=\"library-stat\" href=\"/subjects/in_library#ebooks=true\">\n                            <span class=\"library-stat__figures\">\n                                <span class=\"library-stat__value\">281K</span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"library-stat__label\">Books Read</span>\n                            <svg class=\"library-stat__spark\"\n                                 viewBox=\"0 0 120 28\"\n                                 preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"\n aria-hidden=\"true\"                                  focusable=\"false\">\n                                <polyline points=\"2.0,9.4 6.3,8.5 10.6,8.9 14.9,6.3 19.2,8.8 23.5,10.9 27.8,13.2 32.1,11.8 36.4,11.0 40.7,10.1 45.0,11.6 49.3,9.1 53.6,7.0 57.9,5.2 62.1,6.1 66.4,5.2 70.7,3.9 75.0,3.6 79.3,4.2 83.6,3.1 87.9,2.7 92.2,2.4 96.5,2.0 100.8,2.0 105.1,11.2 109.4,15.5 113.7,21.9 118.0,22.3\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></polyline>\n                            </svg>\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <a class=\"library-stat\" href=\"/recentchanges\">\n                            <span class=\"library-stat__figures\">\n                                <span class=\"library-stat__value\">111K</span>\n                                    <span class=\"library-stat__change\"\n                                          title=\"Change over the month, by 7-day average\"\n                                          aria-hidden=\"true\">↑ 28%</span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"library-stat__label\">Catalog Edits</span>\n                            <svg class=\"library-stat__spark\"\n                                 viewBox=\"0 0 120 28\"\n                                 preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"\n role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Up 28% over the month\"                                  focusable=\"false\">\n                                <polyline points=\"2.0,22.9 6.3,24.2 10.6,24.0 14.9,24.6 19.2,25.0 23.5,25.5 27.8,25.5 32.1,25.0 36.4,24.6 40.7,25.0 45.0,25.2 49.3,25.3 53.6,26.0 57.9,25.4 62.1,19.2 66.4,6.4 70.7,4.9 75.0,3.8 79.3,3.3 83.6,2.1 87.9,2.0 92.2,7.2 96.5,18.3 100.8,17.8 105.1,17.2 109.4,17.0 113.7,16.0 118.0,18.3\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></polyline>\n                            </svg>\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <a class=\"library-stat\" href=\"/lists\">\n                            <span class=\"library-stat__figures\">\n                                <span class=\"library-stat__value\">33K</span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"library-stat__label\">Lists Updated</span>\n                            <svg class=\"library-stat__spark\"\n                                 viewBox=\"0 0 120 28\"\n                                 preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"\n aria-hidden=\"true\"                                  focusable=\"false\">\n                                <polyline points=\"2.0,2.0 6.3,14.5 10.6,8.8 14.9,12.4 19.2,16.4 23.5,19.3 27.8,18.8 32.1,17.4 36.4,17.4 40.7,20.5 45.0,22.8 49.3,21.9 53.6,26.0 57.9,23.8 62.1,19.6 66.4,10.5 70.7,11.7 75.0,9.0 79.3,10.3 83.6,10.0 87.9,12.0 92.2,18.3 96.5,14.4 100.8,10.4 105.1,11.9 109.4,10.5 113.7,4.9 118.0,13.6\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></polyline>\n                            </svg>\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n            </ul>\n        </section>\n</div>\n\n  \n<div id=\"home-resources\">\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <h2>About the Project</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div id=\"home-about\">\n    <div id=\"home-about-mission\">\n      <p id=\"home-about-mission-tldr\">\n        Open Library is an open, editable library catalog, building towards a web page for every book ever published.\n        <a href=\"/about\" class=\"small sansserif\">More</a>\n      </p>\n      <p id=\"home-about-mission-desc\">\n        Just like Wikipedia, you can contribute new information or corrections to the catalog. You can browse by <a href=\"/subjects\">subjects</a>, <a href=\"/authors\">authors</a> or <a href=\"/lists\">lists</a> members have created. If you love books, why not help build a library?\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"home-resource-section\">\n      <h3 class=\"collapse\">\n        <a href=\"https://blog.openlibrary.org/\" class=\"header\">Latest Blog Posts</a>\n      </h3>\n      <ul id=\"olBlog\">\n        <li><a href=\"https://blog.openlibrary.org/2026/08/23/building-a-library-patrons-choose-to-revisit/\">Building a Library Patrons Choose to Revisit</a> - <em>August 23, 2026</em></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://blog.openlibrary.org/2026/08/23/helping-patrons-discover-books/\">Helping Patrons Discover Books</a> - <em>August 23, 2026</em></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://blog.openlibrary.org/2026/07/15/google-summer-of-code-contributors-improve-open-librarys-patron-experience/\">Google Summer of Code Contributors Improve Open Library’s Patron Experience</a> - <em>July 15, 2026</em></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n </div>\n\n        </main>\n            <div class=\"clearfix\"></div>\n<footer>\n    <div id=\"footer-content\">\n        <div id=\"footer-links\">\n            <div>\n                <h2>Open Library</h2>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><a href=\"/about/vision\">Vision</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/volunteer\">Volunteer</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/partner-with-us\">Partner With Us</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/about/jobs.php\" title=\"Jobs\">Careers</a></li>\n    